--TEST--
`Iterator<T>` is `advance()`/`current()` and nothing else, so `yield $k => $v` has no key to carry — `rule:iteration/two-interfaces`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Feed {
    public static function pairs(): Iterator<string> {
        yield "a" => "one";
        yield "b" => "two";
    }
}

foreach (Feed::pairs() as string $k => string $v) {
    echo $k, "=", $v, "\n";
}
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0448]: a `yield` has no key half in Novis
  --> case.nvs:4:15
%A
error[E0448]: a `yield` has no key half in Novis
  --> case.nvs:5:15
%A
